        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "As defined in the glossary, shall be paid upon the recommendation of the principal for duties performed and for the period of time they serve as coaches or sponsors of teams or groups who engage in interscholastic competition or activities directly related to the enhancement of the educational process, provided that the formation and maintenance of such teams or groups throughout the scheduled activity period meets the standards of the Florida High School Activities Association, Orange County School Board, Athletic Conference Association, the Orange County Middle School Principals Association, and other organizations recognized by the Association and the Board.",
